WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 30

01:38.770 --> 01:40.240
Only in this way

01:40.260 --> 01:41.670
will you not get caught in trouble.

01:41.690 --> 01:43.960
No! No!

01:46.770 --> 01:48.640
I often criticize you,

01:50.010 --> 01:51.770
but from the bottom of my heart,

01:52.300 --> 01:54.050
I hope to see you

01:54.260 --> 01:58.000
rise in the official world and get married.

01:58.650 --> 02:00.710
I want to protect you all the way,

02:00.730 --> 02:04.560
but I can't do it anymore.

02:05.730 --> 02:06.800
Listen.

02:06.820 --> 02:08.710
I may not survive.

02:08.730 --> 02:11.120
You have to be resolute

02:11.340 --> 02:13.640
to keep yourself safe.

02:14.010 --> 02:15.250
Got it?

02:21.980 --> 02:23.350
Dad.

02:23.370 --> 02:24.680
Dad!

02:24.700 --> 02:25.730
I'm not your dad!

02:25.730 --> 02:27.160
From now on,

02:27.180 --> 02:28.800
I don't have a son

02:28.820 --> 02:29.830
like you.

02:29.850 --> 02:31.690
You're not my son anymore!

02:33.730 --> 02:34.520
Dad.

02:34.540 --> 02:35.320
Let go of me.

02:35.340 --> 02:36.810
Let go of me.

02:37.060 --> 02:38.280
Dad.

02:39.010 --> 02:40.370
Dad.

02:42.450 --> 02:44.400
Dad!

03:01.570 --> 03:03.890
Guo Youzhi has been put into prison.

03:05.290 --> 03:06.760
What shall we do with you?

03:15.540 --> 03:17.240
Your Majesty, I will

03:17.260 --> 03:18.260
hand over Neiku to you.
(Neiku means Imperial Treasury)

03:18.260 --> 03:20.890
That's what you should do!

03:20.930 --> 03:22.430
As for other punishments,

03:22.450 --> 03:24.250
you have the final say.

03:31.780 --> 03:34.090
Your Majesty.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.140
As for betraying...

03:36.140 --> 03:37.520
As I explained,

03:37.540 --> 03:38.550
I met Zhuang Mohan

03:38.570 --> 03:40.710
just to talk about literature.

03:40.730 --> 03:43.560
It's ridiculous to say I betrayed Nanqing.

03:45.540 --> 03:46.970
Who can give witness?

03:47.010 --> 03:48.470
Who can give witness to

03:48.490 --> 03:49.830
my collusion with Beiqi

03:49.850 --> 03:51.040
and betrayal of Yan Bingyun?

03:51.060 --> 03:53.070
Few people know about

03:53.090 --> 03:54.830
Yan Bingyun's lurking in Beiqi.

03:54.850 --> 03:57.270
Shortly after you met Zhuang Mohan,

03:57.290 --> 04:00.630
Yan Bingyun was arrested by Beiqi.

04:00.650 --> 04:02.400
If it hadn't been you,

04:02.420 --> 04:04.400
how could it have been leaked?

04:04.730 --> 04:06.910
There is someone else

04:06.930 --> 04:08.240
who knew about it.

04:08.260 --> 04:08.850
Who is it?

04:08.850 --> 04:10.200
Fan Xian.

04:13.060 --> 04:14.090
Yan Bingyun had left

04:14.090 --> 04:16.540
when Fan Xian came to the capital city.

04:16.540 --> 04:18.030
How could he know that?

04:18.050 --> 04:19.120
As far as I know,

04:19.140 --> 04:20.720
Fan Xian met Yan Bingyun

04:20.890 --> 04:22.800
on his way here.

04:22.820 --> 04:24.440
It's also possible

04:24.460 --> 04:26.000
that he spilled the beans.

04:26.020 --> 04:27.600
Is that true?

04:28.140 --> 04:30.000
I'll find it out.

04:30.020 --> 04:31.210
But even so,

04:31.210 --> 04:34.030
it's impossible for Fan Xian to collude with Beiqi.

04:34.050 --> 04:35.970
Why is it possible for me to do that?

04:40.980 --> 04:42.250
Investigate!

04:42.580 --> 04:44.680
Get to the bottom of it.

04:44.700 --> 04:46.090
Got it.

05:06.610 --> 05:09.090
Head Chen, you've been working hard

05:09.170 --> 05:10.570
for the nation with great merits.

05:11.490 --> 05:13.370
Let me see you out.

05:15.890 --> 05:17.810
Thank you, Your Highness.

05:34.210 --> 05:36.150
I've heard Fan Xian and you

05:36.170 --> 05:37.760
are like old friends from the start.

05:38.370 --> 05:39.610
Your Highness,

05:39.610 --> 05:41.920
it's the same case for you and Fan Xian.

05:42.610 --> 05:45.280
If Fan Xian is suspicious,

05:45.300 --> 05:48.070
you'll handle it impartially, right?

05:48.090 --> 05:49.600
That's for sure.

05:50.980 --> 05:52.370
That'd be great.

05:53.700 --> 05:56.920
Alright. Let's say goodbye here.

05:59.580 --> 06:01.720
Head, take care.

06:02.700 --> 06:04.880
Your Highness, take care.

06:08.210 --> 06:09.880
Head, do you think

06:10.860 --> 06:13.090
you've lifted a rock

06:13.090 --> 06:15.370
only to drop it on your own toes?

06:16.740 --> 06:19.480
My toes are numb.

06:23.980 --> 06:25.560
Got me involved?

06:25.580 --> 06:26.680
Yeah.

06:26.700 --> 06:27.910
Li Yunrui said

06:27.930 --> 06:29.280
you met Yan Bingyun

06:29.300 --> 06:31.290
on your way to the capital city.

06:31.700 --> 06:32.970
Fan Xian?

06:33.210 --> 06:34.720
Yan Bingyun?

06:36.490 --> 06:37.310
We didn't see each other,

06:37.330 --> 06:38.850
but we did meet.

06:39.210 --> 06:40.520
In this case,

06:40.540 --> 06:41.960
it'll be alright.

06:41.980 --> 06:42.840
It doesn't matter as long as you didn't know

06:42.860 --> 06:44.600
he was going to Beiqi.

06:49.770 --> 06:51.150
A member of the Fourth Division

06:51.170 --> 06:53.150
actually tried to kill his superior.

06:53.170 --> 06:54.000
Yan Ruohai

06:54.020 --> 06:55.840
must take the responsibility.

06:55.860 --> 06:58.190
Teng Zijing is under the command of

06:58.210 --> 06:59.870
his son Yan Bingyun.

06:59.890 --> 07:01.310
The Head was so angry that

07:01.330 --> 07:02.680
he dismissed him from his post,

07:02.700 --> 07:04.000
asking him to

07:04.020 --> 07:06.210
disguise himself with his men as trade caravan

07:06.210 --> 07:08.440
to take over the intelligence network in Beiqi.

07:08.890 --> 07:10.870
It's most confidential.

07:10.890 --> 07:12.470
Master Fei shouldn't have told you about it.

07:12.490 --> 07:13.800
He's got you into trouble.

07:13.820 --> 07:14.870
You knew that

07:14.890 --> 07:15.910
he was going to Beiqi

07:15.930 --> 07:17.350
and he's arrested,

07:17.370 --> 07:18.680
so you're suspicious.

07:18.700 --> 07:20.190
It's no big deal.

07:20.210 --> 07:21.140
No big deal?

07:21.140 --> 07:22.800
Being suspicious is a big deal.

07:22.820 --> 07:23.260
Such being the case,

07:23.260 --> 07:25.090
we can't declare Li Yunrui guilty.

07:25.490 --> 07:26.240
We might have to give up

07:26.260 --> 07:27.720
when it's nearly done.

07:27.860 --> 07:29.350
What did Chen Pingping say?

07:29.370 --> 07:30.840
He said

07:30.860 --> 07:32.520
he needs to see you.

07:32.540 --> 07:33.720
I'm afraid

07:33.740 --> 07:36.010
there will be nothing he can do.

07:36.210 --> 07:37.420
You can't go in.

07:37.420 --> 07:38.140
You have to wait till I report it.

07:38.140 --> 07:38.650
Let me go in.

07:38.650 --> 07:39.140
No way.

07:39.140 --> 07:40.210
I have something to say to His Excellency Fan.

07:40.210 --> 07:41.490
-You can't go in. -Let me go in.

07:41.490 --> 07:42.960
You have to wait till I report it.

07:42.980 --> 07:43.820
I said you can't go in.

07:43.820 --> 07:44.460
Don't try to break in.

07:44.460 --> 07:45.680
Let me in.

07:45.700 --> 07:46.370
Let me in.

07:46.370 --> 07:47.980
I have something to say to His Excellency Fan.

07:47.980 --> 07:48.860
Let me in.

07:48.860 --> 07:49.520
Young Master Guo.

07:49.540 --> 07:51.090
Why are you here?

07:51.170 --> 07:52.370
You can leave.

07:53.700 --> 07:54.850
Fan Xian.

07:56.140 --> 07:57.760
I did it wrong.

07:58.170 --> 07:59.480
What?

08:02.140 --> 08:05.250
Your Excellency, it's my fault.

08:06.090 --> 08:08.350
You must've hit me

08:08.370 --> 08:10.290
because I did something wrong.

08:10.330 --> 08:11.750
I shouldn't have sued you.

08:11.770 --> 08:13.380
I shouldn't have set myself against you.

08:13.400 --> 08:14.440
What?

08:14.460 --> 08:15.910
Are you Guo Baokun?

08:15.930 --> 08:17.690
Is he Guo Baokun?

08:19.050 --> 08:20.150
Your Excellency,

08:20.170 --> 08:22.010
let me kowtow and apologize to you.

08:22.700 --> 08:23.870
Stand up.

08:23.890 --> 08:25.200
Your Excellency.

08:26.300 --> 08:27.870
No matter how hard you hit me or scold me,

08:27.890 --> 08:29.370
I'd never complain.

08:29.740 --> 08:31.530
I just beg you to let off my dad.

08:31.740 --> 08:34.010
Everything is my fault.

08:34.290 --> 08:35.840
Are you here for your dad's sake?

08:37.290 --> 08:39.280
I shouldn't have said those words to you

08:39.490 --> 08:41.770
at the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest.

08:41.900 --> 08:43.760
It has nothing to do with my dad.

08:43.780 --> 08:46.280
Please show mercy to him.

08:46.410 --> 08:48.400
It's of no use to beg me for that.

08:50.100 --> 08:51.680
Please show mercy to him.

08:51.700 --> 08:52.640
Please show mercy to him.

08:52.660 --> 08:53.490
Please show mercy to him.

08:53.490 --> 08:54.920
Guo Baokun, listen to me.

08:55.290 --> 08:57.030
Your dad colluded with the Princess Royal in private

08:57.050 --> 08:57.950
to pursue selfish interests.

08:57.970 --> 08:59.030
A courtier should never do something like that.

08:59.050 --> 08:59.760
I...

08:59.780 --> 09:01.290
Please help us! Please help us!

09:01.290 --> 09:03.080
As I said, it's of no use to beg me.

09:03.370 --> 09:04.370
Your Excellency, please!

09:04.370 --> 09:04.660
Your Excellency.

09:04.660 --> 09:05.850
I can do nothing about it.

09:05.850 --> 09:06.700
Your Excellency, please!

09:06.700 --> 09:07.530
I can do nothing about it.

09:07.530 --> 09:09.470
Li Yunrui shifted the blame onto your dad

09:09.490 --> 09:11.270
to protect herself.

09:11.290 --> 09:12.350
In this case,

09:12.370 --> 09:13.800
nobody could save your dad.

09:13.820 --> 09:14.700
Your Excellency, there...

09:14.700 --> 09:15.640
there must be something you can do.

09:15.660 --> 09:17.440
Please save my dad.

09:17.460 --> 09:19.350
Your Excellency, please.

09:19.370 --> 09:20.640
Your Excellency, please!

09:20.660 --> 09:22.210
Your Excellency, please!

09:24.370 --> 09:27.400
That's all I can say. Please go back.

09:29.370 --> 09:30.000
Let's go.

09:30.020 --> 09:31.320
Your Excellency.

09:31.340 --> 09:32.830
Your Excellency.

09:32.850 --> 09:33.780
Please save my dad.

09:33.780 --> 09:34.890
Your Excellency.

09:35.930 --> 09:37.210
Your Excellency.

09:38.170 --> 09:39.240
Your Excellency.

09:39.260 --> 09:41.080
Your Excellency.

09:41.100 --> 09:42.470
Please save my dad, Your Excellency.

09:42.490 --> 09:45.080
Your Excellency.

09:45.100 --> 09:46.250
Your...

09:46.490 --> 09:48.890
Fan Xian!

09:49.850 --> 09:51.200
Someday,

09:51.220 --> 09:53.650
I'll kill you with my own hands!

10:04.700 --> 10:06.010
You're here.

10:07.370 --> 10:09.570
Wang Qinian told me about that.

10:10.220 --> 10:11.590
Li Yunrui planned to use me

10:11.610 --> 10:12.950
as an excuse.

10:12.970 --> 10:13.610
This time,

10:13.610 --> 10:14.700
I was behind the scenes

10:14.700 --> 10:16.350
and thought I wouldn't be noticed,

10:16.370 --> 10:17.390
but unexpectedly,

10:17.410 --> 10:19.080
I got involved anyway.

10:22.850 --> 10:24.330
Freshly brewed tea.

10:25.900 --> 10:27.960
I understand the current situation.

10:28.700 --> 10:29.900
I heard

10:29.900 --> 10:31.910
Li Yunrui and Zhuang Mohan talk about that,

10:31.930 --> 10:33.810
but I don't have any hard evidence.

10:34.100 --> 10:35.910
Now I'm also a suspect.

10:35.930 --> 10:37.120
I'm afraid it's impossible

10:37.140 --> 10:38.650
to drive her away this time.

10:39.020 --> 10:40.710
But thank you, anyway.

10:40.730 --> 10:41.830
It's only partially successful.

10:41.850 --> 10:43.570
Let's try to do it next time.

10:43.850 --> 10:45.560
The Princess Royal lost.

10:45.580 --> 10:47.370
I see, so I...

10:54.170 --> 10:55.920
What did you say?

10:58.820 --> 11:00.130
Do you know?

11:01.170 --> 11:02.710
Even if you have hard evidence

11:02.730 --> 11:04.840
and His Majesty knows

11:04.900 --> 11:06.270
she colluded with Beiqi

11:06.290 --> 11:07.530
and betrayed Yan Bingyun,

11:07.530 --> 11:10.080
she wouldn't be driven out of the capital city.

11:10.780 --> 11:11.410
Why not?

11:11.410 --> 11:13.160
It's a betrayal of Nanqing.

11:14.140 --> 11:16.830
She's the Princess Royal anyway.

11:16.850 --> 11:19.760
They're not of the same blood, but she's
also a member of the royal family.

11:19.780 --> 11:22.720
His Majesty would just scold her no matter
what a big mistake she made.

11:25.170 --> 11:27.440
So, all my efforts

11:27.460 --> 11:29.080
are in vain?

11:31.820 --> 11:33.480
I promised

11:33.530 --> 11:35.720
to help you drive her out of the capital city.

11:35.900 --> 11:37.400
I'll never

11:37.490 --> 11:39.250
break my promise.

11:42.100 --> 11:43.170
Today, it was my aim

11:43.170 --> 11:45.040
to let her say those words

11:45.260 --> 11:47.690
in the presence of His Majesty.

11:48.220 --> 11:49.050
As far as I know,

11:49.050 --> 11:50.560
Fan Xian met Yan Bingyun

11:50.580 --> 11:52.150
on his way here.

11:52.170 --> 11:53.680
It's also possible

11:53.700 --> 11:55.330
that he spilled the beans.

11:55.780 --> 11:57.480
As she said that,

11:57.580 --> 11:59.830
she made a big mistake.

11:59.850 --> 12:01.480
She has lost

12:01.780 --> 12:03.210
the battle.

12:04.490 --> 12:07.010
She'll be driven out of the capital city.

12:07.930 --> 12:09.710
She won't be punished because of her betrayal of Nanqing,

12:09.730 --> 12:11.570
but she will because of those words.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.920
Is there anything special about that?

12:14.970 --> 12:17.920
She did something His Majesty can't bear.

12:21.260 --> 12:24.690
Is it about me?

12:27.100 --> 12:28.470
You met Yan Bingyun

12:28.490 --> 12:29.920
on your way to the capital city,

12:30.020 --> 12:31.590
which is top confidential.

12:31.610 --> 12:33.000
Only the directors of the Investigator's Office

12:33.020 --> 12:35.570
know about it.

12:36.370 --> 12:37.950
How did she know?

12:37.970 --> 12:38.910
There is only one possibility.

12:38.930 --> 12:42.010
There is a hidden traitor in the Investigator's Office.

12:43.700 --> 12:45.440
You know, the Investigator's Office

12:45.460 --> 12:47.270
is directly under His Majesty.

12:47.290 --> 12:49.210
Getting involved in our business

12:49.340 --> 12:52.080
means a challenge to imperial power.

12:52.100 --> 12:53.450
So,

12:54.370 --> 12:56.770
His Majesty couldn't bear it.

12:58.340 --> 12:59.760
What should we do?

12:59.780 --> 13:02.510
Find him out and get rid of him.

13:02.530 --> 13:05.570
This guy must be influential and powerful.

13:09.820 --> 13:13.210
Here I am. Who wants to see me?

13:15.140 --> 13:18.130
Here I am! Who wants to see me?

13:18.820 --> 13:20.160
Come out!

13:41.930 --> 13:45.080
The leaflets were scattered everywhere,

13:45.370 --> 13:47.200
but you haven't found out

13:47.220 --> 13:48.650
who did it.

13:50.580 --> 13:52.030
I'm ashamed to say the First Division

13:52.050 --> 13:54.250
is responsible for supervising everything in the capital city.

13:57.290 --> 13:59.270
Mobilize everyone you can

13:59.290 --> 14:01.280
to find it out!

14:01.930 --> 14:03.210
Yes, sir.

14:06.340 --> 14:07.770
You can leave.

14:14.730 --> 14:15.960
What's up?

14:19.460 --> 14:21.320
Shadow came to me just now.

14:21.340 --> 14:22.800
We almost fought.

14:22.820 --> 14:23.590
Why?

14:23.610 --> 14:25.150
Chen Pingping was attacked

14:25.170 --> 14:27.160
the other day.

14:27.220 --> 14:28.810
He's suspicious of me.

14:37.530 --> 14:39.770
Is it you, Your Excellency?

14:50.930 --> 14:53.840
Yan Ruohai, how dare you?

14:53.900 --> 14:55.910
If you want to put me to death,

14:55.930 --> 14:57.640
just report me.

14:57.660 --> 14:59.350
Why do you want to kill the Head?

14:59.370 --> 15:00.680
I don't want to see him

15:00.700 --> 15:02.450
destroy the Investigator's Office.

15:04.220 --> 15:06.270
Will you accept Fan Xian

15:06.290 --> 15:08.370
as the Head of the Investigator's Office?

15:09.850 --> 15:12.330
Why didn't Shadow fight with you?

15:13.370 --> 15:15.030
He's not sure.

15:15.050 --> 15:16.710
He tried to sound me out.

15:16.730 --> 15:18.780
I pretended to know nothing about it and he let it go.

15:18.780 --> 15:21.210
Why are you telling me about it?

15:21.850 --> 15:23.080
I want to borrow a few guys from you.

15:23.100 --> 15:24.710
You have your own subordinates.

15:24.730 --> 15:26.370
I don't trust them.

15:26.820 --> 15:27.760
What are you going to do?

15:27.780 --> 15:29.680
To pick someone up out of town.

15:29.700 --> 15:31.010
Who?

15:31.340 --> 15:32.490
You just need to lend me

15:32.490 --> 15:34.000
a few trustworthy guys.

15:34.020 --> 15:35.650
Who are you going to pick up?

15:39.780 --> 15:41.120
It's about Li Yunrui

15:41.140 --> 15:43.250
betraying my son.

15:59.900 --> 16:01.290
It's just a rumor,

16:01.290 --> 16:02.920
Your Excellency.

16:03.340 --> 16:04.680
Zhuang Mohan and his mission

16:04.700 --> 16:06.150
have gone back to Beiqi

16:06.170 --> 16:08.030
the other day.

16:08.050 --> 16:09.000
Get to the point.

16:09.020 --> 16:10.000
My men

16:10.020 --> 16:11.910
caught someone from the mission

16:11.930 --> 16:13.680
and are taking him back to the capital city secretly.

16:13.700 --> 16:15.080
I'm going to pick him up.

16:15.530 --> 16:16.890
Did they catch him on the way?

16:19.730 --> 16:20.830
What do you want to do?

16:20.850 --> 16:22.480
That guy can prove

16:22.820 --> 16:25.890
Zhuang Mohan's relationship with Li Yunrui.

16:26.900 --> 16:28.800
Li Yunrui betrayed my son.

16:28.820 --> 16:31.040
I won't leave it at that.

16:44.460 --> 16:45.590
Won't you

16:45.610 --> 16:47.570
tell the Head about it?

16:47.820 --> 16:49.450
Such being the case,

16:49.700 --> 16:52.600
how could I trust him?

16:52.900 --> 16:56.160
I'll look into it myself.

17:01.140 --> 17:02.150
Zhu Ge,

17:02.170 --> 17:05.110
the Fourth Division is not based in the capital city.

17:05.130 --> 17:06.960
Nowadays, you're the only one

17:07.130 --> 17:08.770
I can trust.

17:08.820 --> 17:11.510
You can choose to help me or report me.

17:11.530 --> 17:13.130
It's up to you.

17:30.980 --> 17:32.890
You can have three men at most.

17:36.250 --> 17:37.650
That'll be enough.

17:57.130 --> 17:58.650
Hold on.

18:28.050 --> 18:29.930
It's okay. You can leave.

18:34.130 --> 18:35.560
Go to the village ahead

18:35.580 --> 18:37.150
and get an ox cart

18:37.170 --> 18:38.530
to take him back.

19:08.410 --> 19:09.960
Zhu Ge?

19:17.100 --> 19:18.680
We've been colleagues for years.

19:18.700 --> 19:19.580
I didn't expect

19:19.580 --> 19:21.290
we'd end up like this.

19:21.340 --> 19:22.930
You can't kill me.

19:23.050 --> 19:23.860
Why not?

19:23.860 --> 19:25.480
Have you ever thought about it?

19:25.580 --> 19:26.930
It might be a trap

19:26.930 --> 19:28.440
set by Chen Pingping

19:28.460 --> 19:30.600
to let you show your true colors.

19:30.620 --> 19:31.990
I really have,

19:32.010 --> 19:32.770
so I've sent

19:32.770 --> 19:33.560
all my spies

19:33.580 --> 19:34.960
to keep an eye on

19:34.980 --> 19:37.200
all relevant parties in the capital city.

19:37.220 --> 19:38.480
I can tell you

19:38.500 --> 19:39.750
all master-hands

19:39.770 --> 19:42.200
of the Investigator's Office in the capital city

19:42.220 --> 19:44.010
haven't been mobilized up to now.

19:44.100 --> 19:45.480
How about Shadow?

19:45.500 --> 19:46.440
He still stays

19:46.460 --> 19:47.990
outside the Head's room.

19:48.010 --> 19:50.130
He's not moved a step from there.

19:53.530 --> 19:55.510
Do you think your men can tail him?

19:55.530 --> 19:58.510
No. They can't tail or stop him.

19:58.530 --> 19:59.340
But

19:59.340 --> 20:00.720
a message will be sent to me

20:00.740 --> 20:02.560
once Shadow gets out of the Investigator's Office.

20:02.580 --> 20:04.480
It'll be too late

20:04.500 --> 20:06.370
even if he rushes here now.

20:07.130 --> 20:08.480
Nobody has ever seen

20:08.500 --> 20:10.440
the Shadow's face.

20:10.460 --> 20:12.030
Haven't you thought

20:12.050 --> 20:13.080
he had swapped

20:13.100 --> 20:15.230
someone else over today?

20:15.250 --> 20:16.050
Before I got out of town,

20:16.050 --> 20:18.150
I talked to him on purpose

20:18.170 --> 20:20.440
and confirmed he's Shadow himself.

20:21.100 --> 20:23.150
You've been thoughtful.

20:23.170 --> 20:24.390
So, it couldn't be a trap

20:24.410 --> 20:26.510
set by the Head.

20:26.530 --> 20:27.930
You're just buying time

20:27.930 --> 20:29.650
and waiting for helpers.

20:29.650 --> 20:31.930
My helpers may not be inside the capital city.

20:31.930 --> 20:33.800
Do you mean black knights?

20:33.820 --> 20:34.740
Black knights

20:34.740 --> 20:36.030
have been hiding out of the city.

20:36.050 --> 20:37.390
But what if I tell you

20:37.410 --> 20:38.680
I also know

20:38.700 --> 20:41.320
about the mobilization of them?

20:41.740 --> 20:44.130
You've even got a spy among black knights?

20:45.930 --> 20:48.410
You've been on guard against Chen Pingping?

20:48.930 --> 20:49.820
Nobody

20:49.820 --> 20:51.390
could save you today.

20:51.410 --> 20:53.150
Do you have anything to say before you die?

20:53.170 --> 20:54.010
Now that you're not

20:54.010 --> 20:55.480
a trusted follower of Chen Pingping,

20:55.500 --> 20:57.560
why do you want to kill me?

20:58.580 --> 20:59.800
I caught that guy

20:59.820 --> 21:01.320
just to find out the truth

21:01.340 --> 21:03.110
about Li Yunrui's betrayal.

21:03.130 --> 21:04.510
It has nothing to do with you.

21:04.530 --> 21:05.770
Why do you...

21:10.580 --> 21:13.250
You're protecting Li Yunrui.

21:15.530 --> 21:17.480
You're her follower.

21:22.740 --> 21:24.440
Have you ever seen Yan Ruohai?

21:24.500 --> 21:26.010
Yes, several times.

21:27.410 --> 21:29.370
I have little contact with him,

21:30.010 --> 21:31.650
but I think

21:31.700 --> 21:33.560
besides Chen Pingping,

21:33.580 --> 21:35.200
among the eight directors,

21:35.530 --> 21:36.840
he and Zhu Ge

21:36.860 --> 21:39.010
are the best two.

21:39.220 --> 21:40.530
What a pity!

21:41.170 --> 21:42.680
Such a capable person

21:42.700 --> 21:45.510
will die tonight.

21:45.530 --> 21:46.990
I should've gone there.

21:47.010 --> 21:47.840
No.

21:47.860 --> 21:50.390
Zhu Ge did it after making full preparations.

21:50.410 --> 21:51.770
He won't fail.

21:52.290 --> 21:53.840
From today on,

21:54.100 --> 21:57.130
the Investigator's Office will also work for me.

21:59.130 --> 21:59.980
What do you think of the line

21:59.980 --> 22:02.530
written by Fan Xian in his poem?

22:02.770 --> 22:04.600
The jade and crystal mansions are so high!
(It's too high and too cold for me.)

22:10.460 --> 22:12.130
Coldness doesn't bother me.

22:12.620 --> 22:15.250
I just want to climb up and have a look.

22:18.650 --> 22:20.030
From tomorrow on,

22:20.050 --> 22:21.380
you'll be in charge of

22:21.380 --> 22:22.750
both the Investigator's Office and Neiku.

22:22.770 --> 22:24.630
You'll be the most powerful woman

22:24.650 --> 22:27.200
in Nanqing.

22:29.890 --> 22:31.930
I've heard a star will fall from the sky

22:32.530 --> 22:34.650
when a talented person dies.

22:35.860 --> 22:38.170
I can't wait to see the night screen hang down.

22:38.650 --> 22:40.320
I'm looking forward to that.

22:50.130 --> 22:51.410
Why?

22:51.530 --> 22:52.290
Do you want to

22:52.290 --> 22:53.560
take over the Investigator's Office

22:53.580 --> 22:55.360
by soliciting Princess Royal's support?

22:55.380 --> 22:57.600
I've never thought about that.

22:57.620 --> 22:59.680
Do you have a grudge against Chen Pingping?

22:59.700 --> 23:00.840
He's the one

23:00.860 --> 23:02.720
I admire most.

23:03.380 --> 23:05.770
It's not for power or for revenge.

23:05.980 --> 23:07.440
So, why do you

23:07.460 --> 23:08.200
work for Li Yunrui?

23:08.220 --> 23:10.680
Of course it's for the sake of Nanqing.

23:10.740 --> 23:12.320
I'd like to know more details.

23:13.580 --> 23:15.030
As I said,

23:15.050 --> 23:17.200
nobody could save you.

23:17.220 --> 23:18.390
What's the point of

23:18.410 --> 23:19.720
wasting time?

23:19.740 --> 23:20.960
Ruohai,

23:20.980 --> 23:23.630
I've been thinking you're imposing.

23:23.650 --> 23:26.230
Don't ruin your image before death.

23:26.250 --> 23:28.050
Kill him.

23:29.980 --> 23:30.890
I'd be really dead

23:30.890 --> 23:32.480
if you still refuse to show up.

23:44.050 --> 23:45.030
Your Excellency,

23:45.050 --> 23:46.720
you're unreasonable.

23:46.740 --> 23:47.560
You said all master-hands

23:47.580 --> 23:48.530
of the Investigator's Office

23:48.530 --> 23:49.510
are kept under watch.

23:49.530 --> 23:50.750
How about me?

23:50.770 --> 23:52.320
Nobody kept me under watch.

23:52.340 --> 23:53.720
Don't you take me seriously?

23:53.740 --> 23:55.110
Zhu Ge looks down upon you.

23:55.130 --> 23:56.650
You should've known that.

23:58.010 --> 23:59.510
Head, why are you...

23:59.530 --> 24:02.370
As I said, it's his trap.

24:05.500 --> 24:07.230
It doesn't make a difference

24:07.250 --> 24:08.630
even if the two of you are here.

24:08.650 --> 24:10.890
Do you really think it's just the two of us?

24:11.170 --> 24:12.340
I don't think you can get reinforcements

24:12.340 --> 24:13.960
out of thin air.

24:14.770 --> 24:16.250
Kill Yan Ruohai!

24:49.100 --> 24:50.800
Black knights?

24:51.530 --> 24:53.050
Impossible.

24:53.740 --> 24:55.270
They've never been mobilized

24:55.290 --> 24:57.110
since they took you back to the capital.

24:57.130 --> 24:58.990
I've received messages every day

24:59.010 --> 24:59.930
that no one has left.

24:59.930 --> 25:00.650
Where did you get

25:00.650 --> 25:02.200
these black knights?

25:02.220 --> 25:04.680
You're really cautious.

25:05.220 --> 25:06.270
Up to now,

25:06.290 --> 25:07.630
I still can't confirm who's the spy

25:07.650 --> 25:11.130
among black knights.

25:22.460 --> 25:24.370
He's not among the main force,

25:25.050 --> 25:27.650
but among the Impedimentum Battalion
that's responsible for army provisions.

25:29.010 --> 25:31.800
That explains why I failed to find anything wrong

25:32.500 --> 25:35.960
while black knights are indeed kept under watch.

25:35.980 --> 25:38.630
Head, can you tell me

25:38.650 --> 25:41.680
where these black knights are from?

25:43.170 --> 25:44.870
You're right.

25:44.890 --> 25:46.290
Since I came back to the capital city,

25:47.250 --> 25:49.770
black knights have never been mobilized.

25:52.580 --> 25:54.080
Do you still remember

25:56.050 --> 25:59.680
who was caught the last time they were mobilized

26:00.700 --> 26:03.530
before I came back?

26:12.290 --> 26:13.270
Take care!

26:13.290 --> 26:14.930
Allow me to leave.

26:18.700 --> 26:20.170
Me?

26:20.340 --> 26:22.150
They helped me catch Si Lili.

26:22.170 --> 26:23.960
Not only Si Lili.

26:34.410 --> 26:37.650
All black knights who left that day are here.

26:37.890 --> 26:39.890
We proclaimed that

26:40.170 --> 26:41.960
they've gone to the northern border.

26:41.980 --> 26:42.650
Actually,

26:42.650 --> 26:43.840
they've been lurking

26:43.860 --> 26:45.030
around the capital city

26:45.050 --> 26:47.170
and waiting for you.

26:49.250 --> 26:51.360
Have you started

26:51.380 --> 26:52.410
to set a trap for me

26:52.410 --> 26:53.910
since then?

26:53.930 --> 26:56.230
No. Even earlier.

26:56.250 --> 26:57.510
Before Fan Xian came to the capital city,

26:57.530 --> 26:59.010
we'd started to get prepared.

26:59.250 --> 27:00.360
Think about it.

27:00.380 --> 27:01.100
When did I

27:01.100 --> 27:02.290
begin to show

27:02.410 --> 27:04.130
my grudge against the Head?

27:06.580 --> 27:07.740
Last night,

27:07.740 --> 27:09.010
in the residence of the Assistant
Minister of Ministry of Penalty,

27:09.010 --> 27:10.770
someone from our Investigator's Office

27:10.770 --> 27:12.650
was also there.

27:13.010 --> 27:14.270
Yan Ruohai,

27:14.290 --> 27:16.250
we don't have a say in this.

27:16.250 --> 27:17.680
Whatever I do,

27:17.700 --> 27:19.080
I do it for Nanqing.

27:19.100 --> 27:20.630
So does the Head.

27:20.650 --> 27:21.410
He's old.

27:21.410 --> 27:22.840
Don't make me arrest you myself!

27:22.860 --> 27:24.320
Do you suspect

27:24.340 --> 27:26.130
it's the Head that betrayed him?

27:26.130 --> 27:27.480
The only way to restart the war

27:27.500 --> 27:29.510
is to assassinate Zhuang Mohan.

27:29.530 --> 27:30.750
Zhuang Mohan is just a cover.

27:30.770 --> 27:32.110
The person we're really going to kill

27:32.130 --> 27:33.600
is Chen Pingping.

27:33.620 --> 27:35.150
I don't want to see him

27:35.170 --> 27:36.380
destroy the Investigator's Office.

27:36.380 --> 27:38.440
Will you accept Fan Xian

27:38.500 --> 27:40.650
as the Head of the Investigator's Office?

27:45.290 --> 27:47.480
You've played the long game.

27:47.890 --> 27:50.230
That's how we managed to let you believe

27:50.250 --> 27:52.360
my grudge against Head.

27:52.380 --> 27:53.560
By carrying out those assassinations,

27:53.580 --> 27:55.080
you just rooted out

27:55.100 --> 27:56.050
the Head's enemies.

27:56.050 --> 27:57.720
We had scruples.

27:57.740 --> 27:59.230
You couldn't have been taken in

27:59.250 --> 28:00.840
if we hadn't played the long game.

28:08.010 --> 28:11.010
You've long schemed to deal with me.

28:11.460 --> 28:12.840
I deserve to lose.

28:12.860 --> 28:14.480
The last question.

28:14.500 --> 28:15.770
Head,

28:16.170 --> 28:16.990
why did you

28:17.010 --> 28:18.890
start to set a trap for me so early?

28:19.170 --> 28:20.650
Because of the assassination in Danzhou.

28:22.890 --> 28:26.320
I received a secret order from the
Investigator's Office to kill the traitor.

28:26.460 --> 28:28.370
Do you work for the Investigator's Office?

28:28.890 --> 28:31.150
The assassination happened

28:31.170 --> 28:33.960
because the wrong order was given.

28:33.980 --> 28:35.600
My son had to take responsibility

28:35.620 --> 28:37.080
and was sent to Beiqi.

28:37.380 --> 28:38.840
The forged order

28:38.860 --> 28:40.680
must have something to do with the imperial harem.

28:40.860 --> 28:42.480
But you have to understand

28:43.220 --> 28:46.890
someone in the Investigator's Office must've served as a helper.

28:47.860 --> 28:49.510
Why do you think it's me?

28:49.530 --> 28:51.600
We've set traps for all directors.

28:51.620 --> 28:52.870
Through screening,

28:52.890 --> 28:54.410
we believe

28:54.620 --> 28:57.130
you're the most likely suspect.

29:00.130 --> 29:02.110
So, this guy

29:02.130 --> 29:04.370
is not from the mission of Beiqi, right?

29:04.530 --> 29:06.270
He's a condemned prisoner from the neighboring county.

29:06.290 --> 29:08.030
He committed murder and arson,

29:08.050 --> 29:10.200
so he deserved it.

29:11.100 --> 29:12.560
Let me ask you again.

29:13.050 --> 29:14.960
Why do you work for Li Yunrui?

29:14.980 --> 29:16.370
What did she promise to give you?

29:24.130 --> 29:25.680
Head,

29:26.010 --> 29:27.960
I've been working in the Investigator's Office for years.

29:27.980 --> 29:30.480
I was proud of my job.

29:30.620 --> 29:31.870
But gradually,

29:31.890 --> 29:35.510
I become frightened and worried.

29:35.530 --> 29:38.230
The Investigator's Office is beyond
control of the Six Ministries.

29:38.250 --> 29:39.910
It wins over the talented,

29:39.930 --> 29:41.150
both self-discipled gentlemen

29:41.170 --> 29:42.510
and people who know small tricks.

29:42.530 --> 29:44.050
It can be said that most of the elites of Nanqing

29:44.050 --> 29:46.840
are under the command of the Investigator's Office.

29:47.010 --> 29:48.930
Supervising everything

29:49.340 --> 29:52.580
is the duty of the Investigator's Office.

29:52.580 --> 29:54.010
But what if it wants to rebel?

29:54.010 --> 29:56.250
Who can stop it doing that?

29:56.770 --> 29:58.770
Do you mean I want to rebel?

29:59.010 --> 30:00.680
You may not do that,

30:00.700 --> 30:02.390
but who can promise it won't happen in the future?

30:02.410 --> 30:03.770
If the Investigator's Office

30:03.770 --> 30:05.560
is in the control of someone with ambition,

30:05.650 --> 30:07.860
and he keeps everything from His Majesty
and manipulates state affairs,

30:07.860 --> 30:09.750
the consequences will be unimaginable.

30:09.770 --> 30:11.890
Are you worried about trouble

30:11.890 --> 30:13.200
that may not come?

30:13.220 --> 30:14.530
Humans are capricious.

30:14.530 --> 30:17.050
How can I sleep without anxiety?

30:20.580 --> 30:24.230
How do you want to get it fixed?

30:24.250 --> 30:25.340
If the Investigator's Office

30:25.340 --> 30:26.560
is a huge beast,

30:26.580 --> 30:28.360
then the leash used to control it

30:28.380 --> 30:31.320
must be in the hands of the royal family.

30:33.700 --> 30:36.680
Why is it the Princess Royal?

30:37.250 --> 30:39.130
You can choose

30:39.820 --> 30:40.910
the Crown Prince.

30:40.930 --> 30:44.200
Disturbances will arise if an emperor's son is in power.

30:44.340 --> 30:46.030
It's a different case for the Princess Royal.

30:46.050 --> 30:47.870
She's a member of the royal family,
but not the emperor's next of kin.

30:47.890 --> 30:49.030
And she's a woman.

30:49.050 --> 30:49.990
She may die anytime

30:50.010 --> 30:51.510
if His Majesty wants.

30:51.530 --> 30:53.630
That's why a prolonged political stability will be achieved

30:53.650 --> 30:55.860
if she takes over the Investigator's Office.

30:55.860 --> 30:57.110
Head.

30:57.130 --> 30:58.960
You really did it for the sake of Nanqing.

30:58.980 --> 31:00.390
That's for sure!

31:00.410 --> 31:01.390
It sounds nicer than it is.

31:01.410 --> 31:03.600
You know nothing about it.

31:03.620 --> 31:04.480
If it were for the sake of Nanqing,

31:04.500 --> 31:05.580
why did she betray our secret agents

31:05.580 --> 31:07.130
to Beiqi?

31:07.580 --> 31:10.560
I really don't understand.

31:15.930 --> 31:18.200
I knew nothing about that.

31:18.220 --> 31:19.080
And I didn't expect

31:19.100 --> 31:20.600
she'd do that.

31:20.620 --> 31:23.650
In this case, why do you still work for her?

31:23.890 --> 31:25.410
As I said,

31:25.410 --> 31:26.320
I hope the Investigator's Office

31:26.340 --> 31:28.150
is in the control of the royal family

31:28.170 --> 31:29.050
to make sure

31:29.050 --> 31:31.030
social and political stability in Nanqing.

31:31.050 --> 31:32.820
As for Li Yunrui's moral quality

31:32.820 --> 31:33.740
and whether she's kind or evil,

31:33.740 --> 31:35.390
it doesn't matter.

31:35.410 --> 31:36.990
There would be room for negotiation

31:37.010 --> 31:38.650
if it were for power or for wealth.

31:39.010 --> 31:42.230
Now that we have different ideas about righteousness,

31:42.250 --> 31:43.840
we've reached the point of no return.

31:43.860 --> 31:45.600
Of course.

31:46.980 --> 31:48.910
Turn him over to His Majesty.

31:48.930 --> 31:50.890
No way!

31:51.770 --> 31:53.230
A cornered beast will still fight, right?

31:53.250 --> 31:54.410
If you take me

31:54.410 --> 31:55.530
to His Majesty,

31:55.530 --> 31:56.500
Li Yunrui is bound to

31:56.500 --> 31:57.600
be driven out of the capital city.

31:57.620 --> 31:59.050
Then my efforts in the past years

31:59.050 --> 32:00.720
will come to nothing.

32:00.740 --> 32:02.990
But if I die today,

32:03.010 --> 32:04.740
nobody could prove Li Yunrui once got involved

32:04.740 --> 32:06.930
in the affairs of the Investigator's Office.

32:15.860 --> 32:18.130
Is Hong Sixiang not in the imperial palace?

32:18.290 --> 32:19.770
No.

32:20.930 --> 32:22.360
Are you sure?

32:22.380 --> 32:23.340
Since you're suspicious of

32:23.340 --> 32:24.510
the Empress Dowager,

32:24.530 --> 32:26.270
I've been staying alert.

32:26.290 --> 32:28.360
As soon as I found Hong Sixiang getting
out of the palace in secret,

32:28.380 --> 32:30.080
I'm here to tell you about it.

32:30.100 --> 32:32.720
Where could the old eunuch go?

32:38.170 --> 32:39.390
Oh no.

32:39.410 --> 32:41.770
Chen Pingping is good at setting a trap.

32:51.340 --> 32:53.110
Eunuch Hong, you're also here.

32:53.130 --> 32:54.630
Such a serious matter

32:54.650 --> 32:56.840
needs someone as a witness.

32:57.220 --> 32:58.560
If you don't want His Majesty

32:58.580 --> 33:00.230
to know about it,

33:00.250 --> 33:02.050
you can kill me

33:02.170 --> 33:04.130
before you commit suicide.

33:04.340 --> 33:06.080
Eunuch Hong, you must be kidding.

33:06.580 --> 33:07.910
Your Excellency,

33:07.930 --> 33:09.630
it's your fault.

33:09.650 --> 33:10.680
It's okay

33:10.700 --> 33:11.800
that you don't consider me a master-hand,

33:11.820 --> 33:12.620
but why haven't you sent someone

33:12.620 --> 33:14.080
to keep watch on Eunuch Hong?

33:14.100 --> 33:16.130
What I want to guard against is the Investigator's Office,

33:16.250 --> 33:17.960
but not the imperial palace.

33:18.170 --> 33:21.890
Your Excellency, let's go back.

33:26.130 --> 33:28.010
Your Excellency, are you going to run away

33:28.010 --> 33:30.050
or kill me

33:30.100 --> 33:32.800
or commit suicide?

33:32.890 --> 33:34.680
It's up to you.

33:34.860 --> 33:38.290
Let's just see if you can do it.

33:50.290 --> 33:51.650
Head.

33:56.980 --> 33:59.050
Did you hear

33:59.340 --> 34:01.170
what Zhu Ge said?

34:01.620 --> 34:02.630
Yeah.

34:02.650 --> 34:04.080
In this case,

34:04.170 --> 34:09.240
it doesn't matter if he's dead.

34:13.900 --> 34:16.670
Head Chen, what do you want to say?

34:16.690 --> 34:18.490
I know Zhu Ge well.

34:19.180 --> 34:21.730
If we take him back to the capital city,

34:22.100 --> 34:25.130
those interrogations

34:27.490 --> 34:30.130
are no different from humiliation.

34:34.250 --> 34:36.270
He's at the end of his rope.

34:36.290 --> 34:40.040
What he wants is just to save face.

34:42.770 --> 34:44.240
Eunuch Hong,

34:44.420 --> 34:46.650
we couldn't bear to be insulted

34:48.900 --> 34:51.800
if it were us, right?

34:56.900 --> 34:58.490
Give it back to him.

35:13.860 --> 35:15.280
Thank you, Head.

35:17.860 --> 35:19.170
Head,

35:20.420 --> 35:23.510
Fan Xian is intelligent and witty.

35:23.530 --> 35:25.170
He's also a great writer.

35:25.290 --> 35:26.750
Among the younger generation,

35:26.770 --> 35:28.400
he's second to none.

35:28.420 --> 35:30.160
Maybe he'll become

35:30.180 --> 35:31.840
a grand master in the literary world

35:31.860 --> 35:34.230
or a famous official that does good to society.

35:34.250 --> 35:36.710
But he's not suitable for taking over the Investigator's Office.

35:36.730 --> 35:37.800
Since he arrived in the capital city,

35:37.820 --> 35:39.320
I've been keeping an eye on him.

35:39.340 --> 35:40.670
He's a genius,

35:40.690 --> 35:41.900
but he doesn't have reverence

35:41.900 --> 35:43.560
for the royal family in his heart.

35:43.580 --> 35:46.030
If he takes over the Investigator's Office,

35:46.050 --> 35:47.600
I'm afraid radical changes would happen.

35:51.050 --> 35:52.100
Do you need me to tell His Majesty

35:52.100 --> 35:54.800
about what you just said?

36:02.490 --> 36:04.560
It's the last time I'm offering a piece of advice.

36:05.450 --> 36:08.360
I've devoted my life to serving Nanqing,

36:08.380 --> 36:10.450
without any selfish motives.

36:11.770 --> 36:13.370
It's a pity that I'm going to die,

36:13.860 --> 36:16.650
but I never regret anything I've done.

36:18.100 --> 36:19.230
Guys,

36:19.250 --> 36:22.840
I'm leaving for that faraway place.

36:46.660 --> 36:47.880
Head Chen,

36:47.900 --> 36:49.650
I'm going back to the imperial palace.

36:50.210 --> 36:51.690
I'll report

36:51.970 --> 36:54.510
what I heard here to His Majesty.

36:54.530 --> 36:56.560
Thank you, Eunuch Hong.

37:31.860 --> 37:33.890
I still remember

37:34.140 --> 37:35.730
how high-spirited you were

37:35.730 --> 37:37.600
when you stepped into the courtyard

37:37.620 --> 37:40.600
the first time I saw you.

37:42.180 --> 37:44.000
I also remember.

37:44.970 --> 37:47.490
Please take him back.

37:58.180 --> 38:01.170
That faraway place.

38:10.180 --> 38:12.280
We'll see each other again someday.

38:15.050 --> 38:16.890
Let's go back.

38:22.250 --> 38:24.370
I didn't plan to make him die.

38:25.100 --> 38:28.400
If you choose a path in life

38:28.420 --> 38:30.930
and walk along it till the end

38:31.180 --> 38:33.230
without giving in,

38:33.250 --> 38:35.240
you can count yourself lucky.

38:58.380 --> 39:00.640
Your Highness, Hong Sixiang getting out of the imperial palace

39:00.660 --> 39:02.800
may not have anything to do with Zhu Ge's issue.

39:03.490 --> 39:05.240
What Director Yan said makes sense.

39:05.340 --> 39:07.130
Your Highness, please don't worry.

39:09.340 --> 39:11.210
Did you see that?

39:12.210 --> 39:13.800
See what?

39:14.860 --> 39:18.320
A shooting star fell and disappeared in a flash.

39:19.530 --> 39:21.210
It's beautiful.

39:31.860 --> 39:33.650
Is that all?

39:33.900 --> 39:35.080
Yes.

39:35.180 --> 39:36.880
I've told you everything that happened today

39:36.900 --> 39:38.270
without any omission.

39:38.290 --> 39:40.730
As for what Zhu Ge said about Fan Xian,

39:40.820 --> 39:42.510
what's your opinion?

39:42.530 --> 39:45.710
It's a serious matter. I don't dare to say anything about it.

39:45.730 --> 39:46.490
Each of them

39:46.490 --> 39:47.990
has their own plan,

39:48.010 --> 39:49.010
but they all said

39:49.010 --> 39:50.510
they're loyal to Nanqing.

39:50.530 --> 39:51.640
They've never thought

39:51.660 --> 39:54.640
what I want them to do.

39:54.660 --> 39:57.920
What you said has profound meaning.

39:57.940 --> 40:00.040
I really don't understand.

40:01.490 --> 40:03.840
Those who pretend not to understand actually get the point.

40:04.900 --> 40:06.490
Let Li Yunrui come here.

40:33.140 --> 40:34.320
Your Majesty,

40:34.340 --> 40:36.840
Her Highness is kneeling outside.

41:13.050 --> 41:14.520
Is Her Highness still kneeling?

41:14.860 --> 41:16.040
Yes.

41:16.420 --> 41:18.890
Nothing has happened in the Imperial Study.

41:20.660 --> 41:22.970
You'll get Her Highness into bigger trouble if you go there!

41:25.140 --> 41:26.650
Do you want to watch it happen without doing anything?

41:28.730 --> 41:30.240
If we can do nothing about it,

41:30.380 --> 41:32.080
maybe someone else can.

41:34.940 --> 41:36.320
At this moment,

41:36.690 --> 41:41.040
nobody would stand out to offend His Majesty.

41:54.010 --> 41:54.880
Your Highness.

41:54.900 --> 41:57.210
You can't go, Your Highness.

42:12.420 --> 42:13.690
Do you want to see me?

42:18.380 --> 42:19.510
What's up?

42:19.530 --> 42:21.320
What is Lin Wan'er

42:21.340 --> 42:22.400
to you?

42:22.420 --> 42:23.800
A wife-to-be.

42:23.820 --> 42:25.410
Do you want to marry her

42:25.660 --> 42:27.710
for Neiku

42:27.730 --> 42:29.160
or for herself?

42:29.180 --> 42:30.600
Even if she's a maidservant

42:30.620 --> 42:31.750
or a slave girl,

42:31.770 --> 42:33.410
I'll marry nobody but her.

42:56.320 --> 42:59.900
In the river of history,

42:59.920 --> 43:03.390
time goes round and round.

43:06.200 --> 43:09.540
Memories about the former and present lives

43:09.560 --> 43:13.630
join each other in an endless way.

43:15.520 --> 43:18.140
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:18.160 --> 43:20.400
one season follows another in a flash,

43:20.400 --> 43:22.900
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:22.920 --> 43:24.520
I just can't give up

43:24.520 --> 43:27.860
to be with you for my whole life.

43:27.880 --> 43:33.350
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:34.600 --> 43:37.150
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:37.440 --> 43:39.480
Year after year in the wandering,

43:39.480 --> 43:42.140
I count the remaining years.

43:42.160 --> 43:44.340
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:44.360 --> 43:46.350
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:46.640 --> 43:49.030
I never feel regretful.

43:49.080 --> 43:50.440
In such a chaotic world,

43:50.440 --> 43:53.420
I still miss you as ever.

43:53.440 --> 43:56.390
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:56.680 --> 43:58.740
With a gentle heart,

43:58.760 --> 44:01.420
I cherish our remaining years.

44:01.440 --> 44:02.960
Even though we have to go through

44:02.960 --> 44:05.470
all the hardships along the journey,

44:05.600 --> 44:12.790
you always stay by my side,

44:12.880 --> 44:15.550
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:15.840 --> 44:17.920
Year after year in the wandering,

44:17.920 --> 44:20.580
I count the remaining years.

44:20.600 --> 44:22.740
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:22.760 --> 44:24.990
even though we end up the destiny,

44:25.200 --> 44:27.380
I never feel regretful.

44:27.400 --> 44:28.800
In such a chaotic world,

44:28.800 --> 44:31.860
I still miss you as ever.

44:31.880 --> 44:34.990
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:35.080 --> 44:37.220
With a gentle heart,

44:37.240 --> 44:39.940
I cherish our remaining years.

44:39.960 --> 44:41.400
Even though we have to go through

44:41.400 --> 44:44.060
all the hardships along the journey,

44:44.080 --> 44:52.840
you always stay by my side...
